cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "This repository is the active public checkpoint record. DOI will be synchronized after Zenodo minting for v0.15.0."
title: "DRMYN Studio: Character Visual Prompt Kit Doctrine for AI-Assisted Film Production"
type: software
version: "0.15.0-character-visual-prompt-kit-checkpoint"
date-released: 2026-05-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/hknbb/drmyn-studio-public"
url: "https://github.com/hknbb/drmyn-studio-public/releases/tag/v0.15.0-character-visual-prompt-kit-checkpoint"
abstract: >
  DRMYN Studio is a metadata-only, schema-validated, human-gated research
  software framework for AI-assisted movie development and movie production
  process design, documentation, validation, and reproducibility. This
  v0.15.0 checkpoint captures the character visual prompt governance layer:
  doctrine and operator-facing prompt kits for C01-C05, including a five-stage
  identity-to-look workflow before real GPT Images 2 external-ref registration.
keywords:
